// KEYCONF - key bindings the mod suggests. ZDoom wiki: https://zdoom.org/wiki/KEYCONF
//
// `defaultbind <key> <command>` binds the key ONLY if neither the key nor
// the command is bound already, so a player's own setup is never changed.
// GZDoom g4.14.2 binds nothing to `+reload` and nothing to R by default
// (gzdoom.pk3 engine/commonbinds.txt, defbinds.txt, leftbinds.txt read on
// 2026-10-25); its Customize Controls menu already lists "Reload"
// (CNTRLMNU_RELOAD, menudef.txt), where a player can move it.
//
// V3 reloads (D132, ADR 014): `+reload` makes the weapon's Reload state
// play when A_WeaponReady allowed it (WRF_ALLOWRELOAD,
// zscript/weapons/magazine.zs). With sd_reloads 0 the key does nothing.
// NOT VERIFIED in the engine (D26): that defaultbind runs from KEYCONF with
// no line in the log.
defaultbind r +reload
